    {
      "id": "block-lesson-58-dialogue",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Lin",
          "hanzi": "你好，你姓什么？",
          "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo, nǐ xìng shén me?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Bonjour, quel est votre nom de famille ?"
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "他姓白。他昨天唱歌，今天不太能说话。",
          "pinyin": "tā xìng bái. tā zuó tiān chàng gē, jīn tiān bú tài néng shuō huà.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Il s’appelle Bai. Il a chanté hier et aujourd’hui il a du mal à parler."
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lin",
          "hanzi": "白先生，你昨天唱歌到几点？",
          "pinyin": "bái xiān sheng, nǐ zuó tiān chàng gē dào jǐ diǎn?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Monsieur Bai, jusqu’à quelle heure avez-vous chanté hier ?"
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "晚上十二点。",
          "pinyin": "wǎn shang shí èr diǎn.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Jusqu’à minuit."
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lin",
          "hanzi": "十二点！这是药，你现在就吃吧。",
          "pinyin": "shí èr diǎn! zhè shì yào, nǐ xiàn zài jiù chī ba.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Minuit ! Voici un médicament, prenez-le tout de suite."
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "他明天可以唱歌吗？",
          "pinyin": "tā míng tiān kě yǐ chàng gē ma?",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Est-ce qu’il pourra chanter demain ?"
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Lin",
          "hanzi": "别唱歌，也别说话，多喝水。",
          "pinyin": "bié chàng gē, yě bié shuō huà, duō hē shuǐ.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Non : ne chantez pas, ne parlez pas, buvez beaucoup d’eau."
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "但是我很想唱歌。",
          "pinyin": "dàn shì wǒ hěn xiǎng chàng gē.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Mais j’ai très envie de chanter."
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Mina",
          "hanzi": "你别再唱歌到十二点了！",
          "pinyin": "nǐ bié zài chàng gē dào shí èr diǎn le!",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Ne rechante plus jusqu’à minuit !"
          },
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Tao",
          "hanzi": "好，我知道了。谢谢医生。",
          "pinyin": "hǎo, wǒ zhī dào le. xiè xie yī shēng.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "D’accord, j’ai compris. Merci, docteur."
          },
          "audio": null
        }
      ],
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "metadata": {
        "stage": "understand",
        "skill": "listening",
        "lessonDay": 54
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "block-lesson-58-reading",
      "storyID": "story-lesson-58",
      "level": "HSK classique 2",
      "title": {
        "fr": "Une visite à l’hôpital"
      },
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "lesson-58-p1",
          "hanzi": "今天我和朋友去了医院。他姓白，昨天晚上唱歌到十二点，今天不太能说话。",
          "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ hé péng you qù le yī yuàn. tā xìng bái, zuó tiān wǎn shang chàng gē dào shí èr diǎn, jīn tiān bú tài néng shuō huà.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Aujourd’hui, je suis allée à l’hôpital avec un ami. Il s’appelle Bai ; hier soir il a chanté jusqu’à minuit et aujourd’hui il a du mal à parler."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": null
        },
        {
          "id": "lesson-58-p2",
          "hanzi": "医生告诉他：吃药，喝水，别唱歌。我觉得他明天就好了。",
          "pinyin": "yī shēng gào su tā: chī yào, hē shuǐ, bié chàng gē. wǒ jué de tā míng tiān jiù hǎo le.",
          "translation": {
            "fr": "Le médecin lui dit : prends ton médicament, bois de l’eau, ne chante pas. Je pense qu’il ira mieux demain."
          },
          "segmentation": [],
          "audio": null
        }
      ],
      "comprehensionExerciseIDs": [
        "ex-l58-reading"
      ],
      "kind": "reading",
      "metadata": {
        "stage": "transfer",
        "skill": "reading",
        "lessonDay": 54
      }
    },
